{"seq":5,"slug":"move-semantics","title":"移动语义与完美转发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/move-semantics","wordCount":1069,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"移动语义与完美转发\">移动语义与完美转发</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>移动语义（Move Semantics）是 C++11 引入的最重要的性能优化特性。它允许将即将销毁的对象（右值）的内部资源「偷取」到新对象中，避免昂贵的深拷贝。完美转发（Perfect Forwarding）则是模板编程中保持参数值类别（左值/右值）不变地传递给下一层函数的技术。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[拷贝语义] --&gt; B[分配新内存]&#10;    B --&gt; C[复制数据]&#10;    C --&gt; D[释放源对象]&#10;    E[移动语义] --&gt; F[转移资源指针]&#10;    F --&gt; G[置空源对象]&#10;    subgraph &quot;性能对比&quot;&#10;    A --&gt; H[&quot;O(n) 时间&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; I[&quot;O(1) 时间&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    A[拷贝语义] --&gt; B[分配新内存]\n    B --&gt; C[复制数据]\n    C --&gt; D[释放源对象]\n    E[移动语义] --&gt; F[转移资源指针]\n    F --&gt; G[置空源对象]\n    subgraph \"性能对比\"\n    A --&gt; H[\"O(n) 时间\"]\n    E --&gt; I[\"O(1) 时间\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>拷贝</th>\n<th>移动</th>\n<th>性能差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>std::string(1MB)</td>\n<td>分配 + 复制 1MB</td>\n<td>指针交换</td>\n<td>~1000x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>std::vector&lt;int&gt;(10万)</td>\n<td>分配 + 复制 400KB</td>\n<td>三个指针交换</td>\n<td>~10000x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>std::unique_ptr</td>\n<td>不允许</td>\n<td>指针交换</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>4 字节拷贝</td>\n<td>4 字节拷贝</td>\n<td>无差异</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"移动构造与移动赋值\">移动构造与移动赋值</h2><p>移动构造函数和移动赋值运算符通过右值引用参数（T&amp;&amp;）接收即将销毁的对象，将其内部资源转移到新对象中：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;utility&gt;&#10;#include &lt;cstring&gt;&#10;#include &lt;algorithm&gt;&#10;&#10;class DynamicArray {&#10;    int* data_;&#10;    size_t size_;&#10;&#10;public:&#10;    explicit DynamicArray(size_t n)&#10;        : data_(new int[n]), size_(n) {&#10;        std::fill_n(data_, n, 0);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    ~DynamicArray() { delete[] data_; }&#10;&#10;    DynamicArray(const DynamicArray&amp; other)&#10;        : data_(new int[other.size_]), size_(other.size_) {&#10;        std::copy_n(other.data_, size_, data_);&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    DynamicArray(DynamicArray&amp;&amp; other) noexcept&#10;        : data_(other.data_), size_(other.size_) {&#10;        other.data_ = nullptr;&#10;        other.size_ = 0;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    DynamicArray&amp; operator=(DynamicArray&amp;&amp; other) noexcept {&#10;        if (this != &amp;other) {&#10;            delete[] data_;&#10;            data_ = other.data_;&#10;            size_ = other.size_;&#10;            other.data_ = nullptr;&#10;            other.size_ = 0;&#10;        }&#10;        return *this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    DynamicArray&amp; operator=(const DynamicArray&amp; other) {&#10;        if (this != &amp;other) {&#10;            DynamicArray tmp(other);&#10;            std::swap(data_, tmp.data_);&#10;            std::swap(size_, tmp.size_);&#10;        }&#10;        return *this;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    size_t size() const { return size_; }&#10;};&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_move() {&#10;    DynamicArray a(1000000);&#10;    DynamicArray b = std::move(a);     // 移动构造：O(1)&#10;    DynamicArray c(100);&#10;    c = std::move(b);                  // 移动赋值：O(1)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;utility></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;cstring></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;algorithm></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style