style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::string s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make_vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                // s 被拷贝（lvalue）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make_vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s));</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // s 被移动（rvalue）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make_vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"world\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 字面量被移动</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v4 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make_vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"foo\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"引用折叠与转发引用\">引用折叠与转发引用</h2><p>完美转发的底层机制是引用折叠（Reference Collapsing）规则。当模板参数 T 被推导为引用类型时，T&amp;&amp; 的行为取决于 T 的类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"template&lt;typename T&gt;&#10;void wrapper(T&amp;&amp; arg) {&#10;    inner(std::forward&lt;T&gt;(arg));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">template</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typename</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wrapper</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> arg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    inner</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">T</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(arg));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>T 推导结果</th>\n<th>T&amp;&amp; 折叠为</th>\n<th>实参类别</th>\n<th>forward 行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>int&amp;</td>\n<td>int&amp; &amp;&amp; → int&amp;</td>\n<td>左值</td>\n<td>转发为左值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>int</td>\n<td>int&amp;&amp;</td>\n<td>右值</td>\n<td>转发为右值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>const int&amp;</td>\n<td>const int&amp; &amp;&amp; → const int&amp;</td>\n<td>const 左值</td>\n<td>转发为 const 左值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>转发引用（forwarding reference，也称万能引用）只在两种上下文中出现：模板参数 T&amp;&amp; 和 auto&amp;&amp;。它们不是右值引用，而是根据传入参数的值类别推导为左值引用或右值引用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"返回值优化\">返回值优化</h2><p>现代编译器通过 NRVO（Named Return Value Optimization）和 RVO（Return Value Optimization）消除函数返回时的拷贝/移动。C++17 将 prvalue 的 RVO 强制为语言标准（mandatory copy elision）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"DynamicArray create_array() {&#10;    DynamicArray arr(1000);&#10;    return arr;                    // NRVO：直接在调用者内存构造&#10;}&#10;&#10;DynamicArray create_temp() {&#10;    return DynamicArray(1000);     // RVO：C++17 强制优化&#10;}&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_rvo() {&#10;    auto a = create_array();       // 零拷贝零移动（NRVO）&#10;    auto b = create_temp();        // 零拷贝零移动（RVO，C++17 保证）&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DynamicArray</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DynamicArray </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">arr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> arr;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    // NRVO：直接在调用者内存构造</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DynamicArray</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_temp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DynamicArray</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // RVO：C++17 强制优化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrate_rvo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_array</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 零拷贝零移动（NRVO）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_temp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 零拷贝零移动（RVO，C++17 保证）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"移动语义的常见陷阱\">移动语义的常见陷阱</h2><p>正确使用移动语义需要理解几个关键陷阱。错误地使用 std::move 可能导致性能下降甚至程序错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;string&gt;&#10;#include &lt;vector&gt;&#10;&#10;std::string create_greeting(const std::string&amp; name) {&#10;    std::string result = &quot;Hello, &quot; + name + &quot;!&quot;;&#10;    return result;            // NRVO 优化，不要写 return std::move(result)&#10;}&#10;&#10;void anti_patterns() {&#10;    const std::string s = &quot;immutable&quot;;&#10;    // std::string moved = std::move(s);  // const 对象移动退化为拷贝&#10;&#10;    std::string a = &quot;hello&quot;;&#10;    std::string b = std::move(a);&#10;    // a.size();              // 合法但值不确定&#10;    a = &quot;reset&quot;;             // 赋值后恢复有效状态&#10;}&#10;&#10;class Widget {&#10;    std::vector&lt;int&gt; data_;&#10;public:&#10;    void set_data(std::vector&lt;int&gt; data) {&#10;        data_ = std::move(data);    // 值传递 + move：统一处理左值和右值&#10;    }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;string></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vector></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> create_greeting</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::string result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Hello, \"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"!\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // NRVO 优化，不要写 return std::move(result)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> anti_patterns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::string s </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"immutable\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // std::string moved = std::move(s);  // const 对象移动退化为拷贝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::string a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"hello\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::string b </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(a);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // a.size();              // 合法但值不确定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"reset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             // 赋值后恢复有效状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Widget</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;int></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> data_;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> set_data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        data_ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">move</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 值传递 + move：统一处理左值和右值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>陷阱</th>\n<th>错误写法</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>return std::move(local)</td>\n<td>return std::move(x)</td>\n<td>return x</td>\n<td>阻止 NRVO 优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动 const 对象</td>\n<td>std::move(const_obj)</td>\n<td>直接拷贝</td>\n<td>const 阻止移动，静默回退拷贝</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移动后使用</td>\n<td>auto b = std::move(a); use(a)</td>\n<td>移动后重新赋值再使用</td>\n<td>移动后状态不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多次移动同一对象</td>\n<td>move(x) 后再 move(x)</td>\n<td>仅移动一次</td>\n<td>第二次移动操作的是空壳</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>移动语义将深拷贝的 O(n) 操作降为 O(1) 的指针交换，是 C++11 最重要的性能优化</li>\n<li>noexcept 移动操作对 std::vector 扩容至关重要，缺少 noexcept 会退回到拷贝</li>\n<li>std::move 是无条件的右值转换，std::forward 是有条件的转发（保持值类别）</li>\n<li>引用折叠规则：T&amp; &amp;&amp; → T&amp;，T&amp;&amp; &amp;&amp; → T&amp;&amp;，是完美转发的底层机制</li>\n<li>C++17 强制 prvalue 的拷贝消除（mandatory copy elision），返回临时对象零开销</li>\n<li>不要对返回的局部变量使用 std::move，这会阻止 NRVO 优化</li>\n<li>移动 const 对象会静默退化为拷贝，编译器不会报错</li>\n<li>移动后的对象处于「有效但不确定」状态，只能执行析构和赋值操作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../cpp-core-language/types-variables\">类型系统与变量</a>——移动语义建立在值类别（lvalue/prvalue/xvalue）之上，回看值类别理论理解 T&amp;&amp; 绑定规则。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../templates-generics/function-templates\">函数模板</a>——完美转发依赖转发引用和模板参数推导，理解引用折叠的模板基础。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../rust-language/ownership-and-borrowing/ownership-rules\">Rust·所有权规则</a>——Rust 的「移动」是默认语义且编译器禁止移动后使用，对比 C++ 显式 std::move 与「有效但未指定」状态。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../go-language/data-structures/pointers-and-references\">Go·指针与引用</a>——Go 没有移动语义而用值/指针传递与 GC，对比不同语言在「避免深拷贝」上的设计取舍。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"移动语义与完美转发","id":"移动语义与完美转发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"移动构造与移动赋值","id":"移动构造与移动赋值"},{"level":2,"text":"std::move 与 std::forward","id":"std-move-与-std-forward"},{"level":2,"text":"引用折叠与转发引用","id":"引用折叠与转发引用"},{"level":2,"text":"返回值优化","id":"返回值优化"},{"level":2,"text":"移动语义的常见陷阱","id":"移动语义的常见陷阱"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"智能指针与 RAII","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/memory-management/smart-pointers"},"next":{"title":"移动语义与右值引用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/cpp-modern/move-semantics"}}